<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA PLANS PLN 0.7 1996 PAYOUT.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA PLANS PLN 0.7 1996 PAYOUT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish garment maker Wolczanka SA plans to pay a 0.7 zlotys per share dividend in 1996, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Wolczanka said the payout would be voted at the company's general shareholders meeting planned for May 21.</p>
<p>Last year Wolczanka also paid a dividend of 0.7 zlotys per share. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
